<title>USA: Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp names new pres.</title>
<headline>Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp names new pres.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp said Monday it named David Vandewater president of Columbia.</p>
<p>Vandewater remains as chief operating officer, a position he has held since 1991.</p>
<p>Vandewater replaces Rick Scott as president.  Scott remains with the company as chief executive and chairman of the baord.</p>
</text>
